window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>An Interconnected Standalone Dark College Romance</p> <ul> <li>Stalker</li> <li>Primal hunt for sorority sisters</li> <li>Murder mystery</li> <li>Secret society and cult rituals</li> </ul> <p><b>ON MONDAYS WE RUN. IF WE'RE CAUGHT... WE'RE </b><b><i>BOUGHT</i></b><b>.</b></p> <p>I must win on Monday.</p> <p>This Game is what I’ve sprinted, sparred, and sweated for.<br> Not just because everyone calls me <i>Sigma’s Savior</i>.<br> Not only for the Lunar Chalice.<br> No.<br> On Monday I must escape the hunter at the Massacre.<br> Because if I don’t…<br> <b>I’m </b><b><i>his</i></b><b>.</b><br> <br> <i>_________<br> It’s an honor to be appointed to a Viscount as a sister of one of the sororities of Northview University. Alumni end up in positions of unquestionable power across the country. What each do to earn their spots is not for the weak.</i></p> <p><i>Fraternities and sororities vie for points during the Greek Games that occur throughout the academic year. Brothers who make it to their senior year are appointed a sorority sister during The Culling, akin to a wedding ceremony. However, this bond is for life and the penalties for rebellion are unfathomable.</i></p>"; 
